-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T20:11:56-07:00","id":1384552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1384532#post1384532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does it feel like Great Steak or an orgasm?</div> </div> </div> </div>To the victim, feeding may feel like taking a shot of heroin - with all that implies. To vampires, we are just food. Food they have to sometimes flatter and lie to, but still just food.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T20:13:03-07:00","id":1384553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1384551#post1384551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's not what I've heard.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only first hand experiences count! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T20:21:42-07:00","id":1384554,"title":"","content":"I am not taking your hand as evidence you are good at sex - you hand has a limited range of experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T20:38:47-07:00","id":1384555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1384554#post1384554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am not taking your hand as evidence you are good at sex - you hand has a limited range of experience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oooh, that is a bit presumptuous. Regardless, my own experiences are 100% verified by me for me, and they are all absolutely better for me than sexual experiences that don\u2019t involve me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T20:56:44-07:00","id":1384559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1384552#post1384552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To the victim, feeding may feel like taking a shot of heroin - with all that implies. To vampires, we are just food. Food they have to sometimes flatter and lie to, but still just food.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the experience of feeding is even better for vampires than being fed on by mortals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-29T00:11:15-07:00","id":1384588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1384554#post1384554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am not taking your hand as evidence you are good at sex - you hand has a limited range of experience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let us not speculate about poster's sex lives or lack thereof.<br /> <br /> After all, I have a harem of beautiful Blood Bound Lasombra women. In real life.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-30T14:42:46-07:00","id":1384926,"title":"","content":"This is how I view it, and how I depict it in my chronicles.<ul><li>Vampires are essentially sexless creatures. Being dead, they don't have the hormones or biology that keep the sex drive active.</li> <li>Nevertheless, many vampires are still in the <i>habit</i> of being sexual creatures from their living days. This is a function of time and Humanity. The more time that goes by since you were living, and the lower the Humanity you have, the less likely this is to be part of the vampire's psychological state.</li> <li>The erotic isn't just limited to physical drives. Over time though, this transitions from a normal human sex drive to a vampire's desire for the blood of the living. Feeding is what ultimately becomes erotic. The physical act of sex becomes nothing more than any other physical act like a handshake, hugging, or manual labor.</li> <li>A vampire could still engage in the physical act of sex. Most just <i>normally</i> wouldn't want to given the above. However, they're still just corpses. So humans having sex with vampires is normally just like them engaging in necrophilia.</li> <li>However, vampires with high enough humanity to normally appear human could fake it. And since vampires can spend Blood Points to appear more human, even vampires with less humanity could do so. So if it is part of someone's feeding pattern, it's still an option for them.</li> <li>Once a mortal is being fed on (except for a Flaw like Grip of the Damned), the ecstasy and similar associations can easily make them think that they were engaged in the act of sex so actual coitus doesn't need to happen.</li> </ul>As ST, I roleplay my NPCs based on these guidelines. If important to my players, this is how I explain it to them, and then I leave it up to them how they want to roleplay their own PCs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T15:42:41-07:00","id":1385471,"title":"","content":"I've always kind of viewed it as 'yes vampires can have sex, but generally only fledglings do it for any reason other than manipulation or feeding'.<br /> <br /> One way I've described the idea to people is that yes, while under blush of life a kindred essentially acts like a living person when viewed from the outside, and can move bodily fluids around if they need to, and their senses might even be enhanced if they've invested in the right Disciplines. But to a vampire feeding and fucking are the same action, and even if we assume that the Kiss doesn't give the vampire any additional pleasure then feeding on a healthy human is equivalent to the best orgasm of your life while simultaneously eating a heroin-marinated steak cooked by a world class chef. Sure there might be better experiences out there, but regular sex won't feel as good without the Kiss, in which case much of the pleasure is coming from the Kiss and vampires will learn to associate the pleasure with that rather than sex.<br /> <br /> Now there are still reasons why a kindred might decide to have sex, especially as the walking snacks seem to be motivated by it and sometimes have useful things besides blood. And there's certainly some that will have sex just for fun, probably some Brujah trying to make a point about Humanity. But its more similar to how a few vampires will eat food for fun, it's not common and kindred society looks down on it. It's such a <i>human</i> hobby, why couldn't you just take up knitting or something else less embarrassing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T18:41:31-07:00","id":1385500,"title":"","content":"In my games, Kindred are basically Thrashing Dragon types, embodying voraciousness in all things, including sex. A trait I adopted from versions of vampires like Necroscope, What We Do In the Shadows, and that sort. That said, in practice it is almost irrelevant. My games aren't about sex, even though they assume plenty of it is happening off-screen. It mostly comes up as an example of Elder excess and abuse, essentially the orgy in &quot;What We Do In the Shadows&quot;, but not played for laughs.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T06:47:54-07:00","id":1388026,"title":"","content":"Just a sudden thought. Instead of asking a vampire to roll to fake having sex, why not have them roll to see if they can enjoy having sex? <br /> <br /> So high humanity still automatically allow your character to have sex, but for 7 and lower, a vampire will have to try to bring to mind what sex feels like and try to remember the pleasure of having sex. <br /> <br /> If they fail, they still had sex, they just don't seem to enjoy it. <br /> Just a sudden thought on how this can make more sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26067-wingstorm","name":"Wingstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T07:00:10-07:00","id":1388032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1383767#post1383767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Sex is like pizza, even when it's not good, it's still kinda good.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Late to the party here, but this is probably the best example I've ever seen of describing Vampire Sex, and one I'll use from now on when asked about the matter. Everyone loves pizza, and pizza is always good... but yaknow, that fine rare quality crafted Steak? That's the Blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3769-orphan81","name":"Orphan81","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3769_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T07:16:51-07:00","id":1388038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Orphan81</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1388032#post1388032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Late to the party here, but this is probably the best example I've ever seen of describing Vampire Sex, and one I'll use from now on when asked about the matter. Everyone loves pizza, and pizza is always good... but yaknow, that fine rare quality crafted Steak? That's the Blood.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then you have never eaten such a low quality frozen pizza, that you are going to ask yourself if there need a clearly differentiation made to be. Because the one I eat it whas not even a little bit good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T07:21:49-07:00","id":1388041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Koronus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1388038#post1388038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then you have never eaten such a low quality frozen pizza, that you are going to ask yourself if there need a clearly differentiation made to be. Because the one I eat it whas not even a little bit good.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This is nitpicking for nitpicking sake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3769-orphan81","name":"Orphan81","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3769_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T09:38:10-07:00","id":1388066,"title":"","content":"What exactly are they supposed to be incapable of doing anyway? The motions? The social interaction? The physiological responses? What happens if they fail the roll?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T11:23:41-07:00","id":1388097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spencer from The Hills</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1388066#post1388066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What exactly are they supposed to be incapable of doing anyway? The motions? The social interaction? The physiological responses? What happens if they fail the roll?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's not made clear, just &quot;you cannot have sexual intercourse <i>per se</i> but you can fake it with a roll&quot;. (Female characters may already be familiar with this approach prior to being Embraced).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/100-jezmiller","name":"JezMiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T11:46:10-07:00","id":1388103,"title":"","content":"I always found it funny how vehemently earlier editions defended that vampires didn't have sex while writing multiple characters with lovers in every book.<br /> <br /> Dark Ages: Europe, for instance, had a profusion of vampire Princes with lovers fighting against revolutionaries and their lovers.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T12:52:44-07:00","id":1388124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JezMiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1388097#post1388097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not made clear, just &quot;you cannot have sexual intercourse <i>per se</i> but you can fake it with a roll&quot;. (Female characters may already be familiar with this approach prior to being Embraced).</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly older editions got it right by essentially stating 'when under Blush of Life vampires are physically capable of having sex'. No strict ruling on if they seek it out, and a note that bitig people feels massively better if you aren't a Giovanni.<br /> <br /> The 'high Humanity for sex' rules are possibly the worst part of V5.<br /> <br /> As a side note, I do want to point out that not every human is interested in sex, not every human enjoys sex, and not every human enjoys all instances of sex they have (it is a bit like pizza in that regard). Why should vampires be any different, the only question should be which side of the spectrum should they swing to. I prefer them being relatively nonsexual but overtly romantic, vampires develop romantic attractions towards people and tend to build herds because of those attractions, but I've met people who like the opposite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T13:35:10-07:00","id":1388141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwoDSix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1388124#post1388124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly older editions got it right by essentially stating 'when under Blush of Life vampires are physically capable of having sex'. No strict ruling on if they seek it out, and a note that bitig people feels massively better if you aren't a Giovanni.<br /> <br /> The 'high Humanity for sex' rules are possibly the worst part of V5.<br /> <br /> As a side note, I do want to point out that not every human is interested in sex, not every human enjoys sex, and not every human enjoys all instances of sex they have (it is a bit like pizza in that regard). Why should vampires be any different, the only question should be which side of the spectrum should they swing to. I prefer them being relatively nonsexual but overtly romantic, vampires develop romantic attractions towards people and tend to build herds because of those attractions, but I've met people who like the opposite.</div> </div> </div> </div>Random aside but the &quot;High Humanity for Sex&quot; thing is actually from Revised.<br /> <br /> It also depends on how its presented at your table. I tend to think vampire attraction is related to blood so all of them eventually become rather, &quot;male, female, other, it doesn't matter because the blood is more intimate than sex.&quot; However, other games strongly prefer their characters to be heterosexual, asexual, or homosexual with the idea of the Embrace changing that disturbing to them.<br /> <br /> Whatever works for your players.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Koronus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383761-v5-so-do-vampire-still-have-great-sex-or-no-sex?p=1388038#post1388038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then you have never eaten such a low quality frozen pizza, that you are going to ask yourself if there need a clearly differentiation made to be. Because the one I eat it whas not even a little bit good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oddly, this does apply to vampires.<br /> <br /> Low-quality pizza is the best way to describe animal blood to a vampire. It is the exception to the rule. You may eat it but it's not something you ever want to try again.<br /> <br /> Doubly so when compared to the real thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-13-2020, 04:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}